*==============================================================================*
* TIMES.jl reference harness hook (not part of TIMES).
* Included by main_ext.mod for stage pp_prelv when 'TJLREF' is passed to
* initmty.mod, i.e. at the extensions' pp_prelv (ppmain.mod L615, v4.9.7):
* after pp_prelv.vda, once RPCS_VAR and PRC_CAPACT are set and before the QA
* of FLO_SHAR and the levelising. An M1.3 checkpoint: dumps every symbol
* declared so far, only in runs the harness starts with --TJL_CHECKPOINTS=1
* (the pre-solve run).
*==============================================================================*
$IF SET TJL_CHECKPOINTS execute_unload 'tjl_prelv.gdx';
